Expreduce, https://github.com/corywalker/expreduce (MIT; LICENSE beside this file).
Commit 9c5d539cbd3dd8990d852c01801f91aed159d9ce (2024-11-30).

resources/ is that commit's expreduce/resources/*.m, without the Rubi rule
files (rubi/, rubi.m, rubi_loader.m), which hold no test cases:

    git clone https://github.com/corywalker/expreduce
    git -C expreduce checkout 9c5d539cbd3dd8990d852c01801f91aed159d9ce
    cp expreduce/expreduce/resources/*.m resources/ && rm resources/rubi*.m

cases/ is generated from resources/ by corpus/tools/extract_expreduce.py,
run from cassini-core/ in a Python environment with Mathics3 10.0.1:

    python corpus/tools/extract_expreduce.py corpus/vendor/expreduce corpus/vendor/expreduce/cases
